body:
Missing @source directive for @object-ui/react package. The CRM app imports and uses components from @object-ui/react (SchemaRendererProvider, SchemaRenderer), and this package contains Tailwind utility classes in files like SchemaRenderer.tsx and form/FieldFactory.tsx. Without scanning this package's source files, Tailwind won't generate the necessary utility classes used by these components, potentially causing incomplete styling.

Add this directive to match the pattern used in packages/runner/src/index.css:
@source '../../packages/react/src/**/*.{ts,tsx}';
```suggestion
@source '../../packages/fields/src/**/*.{ts,tsx}';
@source '../../packages/react/src/**/*.{ts,tsx}';
```
